There are 3 options for adding data immediately available to you, but they all go the same form, which has 4 main sections of interest.

The first section is 'Source'. Your 'Select Drive URI' should be the URL of your drive's copy of the spreadsheet 'SegmentingRows_1' I shared a couple weeks back. 'Sheet range' allows an interesting level of precision in that you can specify gSheet AND cell range, so we can easily exclude from '3Attributes' the 'Category' attribute (in column E), Pivot Tables, Bar Charts, and the whole sheets 'Silly_CSV' and 'Original_CSV'.

