The second section is 'Destination'. Pretty straight forward with a few options that are entirely up to you. 'Project' should be what you named your 'New Project' earlier. 'Dataset' can be anything that you want it to be, but I tend towards the hyper-literal when it comes to data. Same with 'Table', but I added an underscore to underscore this data is ready for database operations.

