So String:Yes to Integer:1 to Boolean:True.
That is a major change and we should query to confirm accuracy that 1s are now Trues. Finally though, the fourth section is 'Advanced Options'. Skipping headers here instead of earlier in 'Sheet range' potentially allows Pivot tables to be a data source, but more importantly, it disallows GCP from making guesses regarding which columns in the data match to which columns in the Schema. I include headers and make their names identical for matching, then skip them as data points.

