If you refresh the BigQuery tab, you will find your new dataset and table in your 'Explorer' section. From there, you can right click the table 'Query' and a SQL workspace will pop up. Final question to answer, 'How can we confirm the 1s are Trues and 0s are False?'

SELECT * FROM `for-linkedin-sharing.Linkedin_Project.3_Attributes` LIMIT 10
Save the query as a Classic Query and compare your outputs to your gSheet. With this workspace, we can add data and practice SQL for free with some limitations, but it is worth noting this is not connecting to a relational database (more on that another day). WELCOME TO BIGQUERY STUDIO!
